## SQ-HOP-01 | no Brewing: no hops item, salad, bag, wild hops or hops vine registered; no hearthandharvest:hops error
@group A
@commands Fold into SQ-DEP-02 (boot without `creativebrewing-*.jar`): `/zq items hearthandharvest:hops`, `/zq items hearthandharvest:hops_salad`, `/zq items hearthandharvest:hops_bag`, `/zq items hearthandharvest:wild_hops`, `/zq blocks hearthandharvest:hops_vine`
@pass none registered; no `hearthandharvest:hops` error in `latest.log` (recipes, tags, trades, compost skip hops); Common's `[item_dict] Missing/invalid item IDs` WARN listing the hops ids is expected without Brewing
@fails `HHBlocks.HOPS_ON`, the `has.mod('vinery')` guards in `hearthandharvest/recipes.js`, `tags.js`, `trades.js`, `compost.js`
@from batches/r1115/p7_nb.qb
> zq items hearthandharvest:hops
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] items id hearthandharvest:hops
> zq items hearthandharvest:wild_hops
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] items id hearthandharvest:wild_hops
> zq blocks hearthandharvest:hops_vine
waitlog \[zq\] done 20
reject \[zq\] blocks id hearthandharvest:hops_vine
shell grep -nE "hearthandharvest:(hops|wild_hops)" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-260 | head -8; echo "hops lines: $(cat logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | grep -cE 'hearthandharvest:(hops|wild_hops)')"
look zq lists no hops item / block (hops_salad and hops_bag are covered by the hearthandharvest:hops text query); no hops error line

## SQ-HOP-02 | hops item on a log face places a hops vine (north=true, age 0); one hops used
@group A
@commands `/setblock 600 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log`; `/pbot hold G hearthandharvest:hops 2`; `/pbot use G 600 -60 520 south` (south face); `/execute if block 600 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0]`; `/zhh5 hand G`
@pass "Test passed"; hand count 1
@fails `HHItems.HOPS` (ItemNameBlockItem of the vine), `HopsVineBlock` VineBlock placement
@from batches/r1115/p5_a1.qb
> setblock 600 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> clear G
> pbot hold G hearthandharvest:hops 2
> pbot use G 600 -60 520 south
> execute if block 600 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0] run say HOP02-vine
> zhh5 hand G
