expect HOP02-vine$
expect \[zhh5\] hand id=hearthandharvest:hops count=1 
look "Test passed"; hand count 1

## SQ-HOP-03 | hops vine grows to age 3 at randomTickSpeed 3000 in 10 s (open sky, mid autumn)
@group A
@commands `/setblock 602 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log`; `/setblock 602 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0]`; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 3000`; wait 10 s; `/execute if block 602 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[age=3]`; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 3`
@pass "Test passed" (open sky, light 15). Out of season the crop season may stop growth: run at an in-season date
@fails `HopsVineBlock.randomTick` (1 in 5, light 9 at the block above), crop season tag `autumn_fruit`
@from batches/r1115/p5_a1.qb
