@pass one `vinery:white_grapejuice_wine_bottle`, then `vinery:savanna_red_grapejuice_bottle`, `vinery:jungle_white_grapejuice_bottle`; basin empty after each; a single basin (1 slot) cannot hold both items: the recipes need the 2x2 group
@fails `hearthandharvest/vinery_stomping.js` (`creativedelight:stomping/*_grapejuice`), `StompingRecipe.findAssignment`
@jars creativedelight powergrid
@from batches/r1115/p5_a1.qb
> clear hb1
> tp hb1 302.5 -59 206.5 0 60
> pbot hold hb1 hearthandharvest:stomping_basin 4
> pbot use hb1 304 -61 208 up
> pbot use hb1 305 -61 208 up
> pbot use hb1 304 -61 209 up
> pbot use hb1 305 -61 209 up
> zhh2 basin 304 -60 208
> zhh2 basin 305 -60 209
> zq items vinery:white_grape
> zq items savanna_grapes_red
> zq items jungle_grapes_white
> zq items grapejuice
waitlog \[zq\] items matching grapejuice: \d+ 30
# single basin (1 slot) cannot hold both: insert into a lone basin
> setblock 312 -60 208 hearthandharvest:stomping_basin[facing=north]
> zhh2 insert 312 -60 208 vinery:white_grape 3 up
> zhh2 insert 312 -60 208 vinery:wine_bottle 1 up
> zhh2 basin 312 -60 208
look group formed (controller 304 -60 208); ids exist; lone basin: wine bottle remainder 1 (one slot taken by the grapes)

## SQ-HH-266c | hops: insert remainder 3, basin empty; bot click with hops passes, hops not used
@group A
@commands `/zhh2 insert 176 -60 208 hearthandharvest:hops 3 up`; bot right-click with hops
@pass `remainder 3`; basin empty; the bot's click passes (hops not used up)
@fails `StompingInputs` (hops are in no stomping recipe)
@jars creativedelight powergrid
