## SQ-HOP-12 | hops vine ages 0 to 2: tree fertilizer, IE and Botania fertilizer, organic mash, manure grow it one age and are used up; a feather passes
@group A
@commands per item a log at x -60 520 and `hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]` at x -60 521; `/cdevtest use x -60 521 held=ITEM*2 face=north`; feather on an age 1 vine
@pass each fertilizer: `main=ITEM*1`, state `age=2`; the feather: `main=minecraft:feather*2`, state still `age=1`; no hops item dropped
@fails `HopsVineBlock.use` (`isFertilizer`, `#creativedelight:bonemeal_like`, `#hearthandharvest:bonemeal_substitutes`); tags not loaded: SQ-HOP-14
> forceload add 650 500 680 540
> setblock 660 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 661 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 662 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 663 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 664 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 665 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> cdevtest place 660 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest place 661 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest place 662 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest place 663 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest place 664 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest place 665 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest use 660 -60 521 held=create:tree_fertilizer*2 face=north
> cdevtest use 661 -60 521 held=immersiveengineering:fertilizer*2 face=north
> cdevtest use 662 -60 521 held=botania:fertilizer*2 face=north
> cdevtest use 663 -60 521 held=vintagedelight:organic_mash*2 face=north
> cdevtest use 664 -60 521 held=hearthandharvest:manure*2 face=north
> cdevtest use 665 -60 521 held=minecraft:feather*2 face=north
> cdevtest items 662 -60 521 6
expect verb=use main=create:tree_fertilizer\*1 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=2,
expect verb=use main=immersiveengineering:fertilizer\*1 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=2,
expect verb=use main=botania:fertilizer\*1 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=2,
expect verb=use main=vintagedelight:organic_mash\*1 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=2,
expect verb=use main=hearthandharvest:manure\*1 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=2,
expect verb=use main=minecraft:feather\*2 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=1,
reject verb=items .*hearthandharvest:hops:
look five fertilizers each used once and the vine one age up; the feather kept and the vine unchanged; no hops on the ground

## SQ-HOP-13 | bone meal (vanilla path) grows an age 0 vine; the fertilizer bag grows it and loses 1 durability; age 3 with fertilizer harvests and keeps the fertilizer
@group A
@commands log + vine age 0 at 666, age 1 at 667, age 3 at 668; `/cdevtest use` with `minecraft:bone_meal*2`, `hearthandharvest:fertilizer_bag`, `create:tree_fertilizer*2`; `/cdevtest items 668 -60 521 2`
@pass bone meal: `main=minecraft:bone_meal*1`, age 1 or more; bag: `main=hearthandharvest:fertilizer_bag*1{Damage:1}`, age 2; age 3: state `age=1`, `main=create:tree_fertilizer*2`, 1 or 2 `hearthandharvest:hops` on the ground
@fails bone meal unchanged: the `BoneMealItem` pass (`held.getItem() instanceof BoneMealItem`) or `isValidBonemealTarget`; bag shrunk instead of damaged: `isDamageableItem` branch
> setblock 666 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 667 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> setblock 668 -60 520 minecraft:oak_log
> cdevtest place 666 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=0]
> cdevtest place 667 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=1]
> cdevtest place 668 -60 521 hearthandharvest:hops_vine[north=true,age=3]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> cdevtest use 666 -60 521 held=minecraft:bone_meal*2 face=north
> cdevtest use 667 -60 521 held=hearthandharvest:fertilizer_bag face=north
> cdevtest use 668 -60 521 held=create:tree_fertilizer*2 face=north
> cdevtest items 668 -60 521 2
expect verb=use main=minecraft:bone_meal\*1 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=[123],
expect verb=use main=hearthandharvest:fertilizer_bag\*1\{Damage:1\} off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=2,
expect verb=use main=create:tree_fertilizer\*2 off=empty state="?hearthandharvest:hops_vine\[age=1,
expect verb=items .*hearthandharvest:hops:[12]\b
look bone meal used once and the vine grown; the bag damaged, not used up; the ripe vine picked with the fertilizer kept

## SQ-HOP-14 | tags: #creativedelight:bonemeal_like holds the five fertilizers; block tag #creativedelight:clip_break_overlay holds the three rugs
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest tag item creativedelight:bonemeal_like`; `/cdevtest tag block creativedelight:clip_break_overlay`
@pass item tag n=5 (`create:tree_fertilizer`, `botania:fertilizer`, `immersiveengineering:fertilizer`, `hearthandharvest:fertilizer_bag`, `vintagedelight:organic_mash`); block tag n=3 (`hearthandharvest:straw_rug`, `hearthandharvest:hay_rug`, `farmersdelight:canvas_rug`)
@fails `hearthandharvest/tags.js` (`i.t_bonemeal_like`), `hearthandharvest/machine_tags.js` (`i.t_clip_break_overlay`); a missing mod drops its entry
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:bonemeal_like
> cdevtest tag block creativedelight:clip_break_overlay
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=creativedelight:bonemeal_like n=5\b
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativedelight:clip_break_overlay n=3\b
look the item tag lists the five fertilizers, the block tag the three rugs

## CQ-HOP-02 | rug crack overlay stays on the block; the rug still draws its fringe
@group client
@commands survival; place a straw rug, a hay rug and a canvas rug on grass, and a stone block; mine each slowly (no efficiency) and watch the crack, then look at each placed rug from the side
@pass the crack shows only within the block's 0 to 1 box on all three rugs, nothing on the fringe that hangs past the edge; the rugs still draw their fringe when not being mined; the stone's crack is unchanged; no `BreakOverlayClipMixin` error in latest.log
@fails `BreakOverlayClipMixin` not applied (Forge `BlockRenderDispatcher.renderBreakingTexture` signature), `client/BreakOverlayClip` quad filter, block tag missing (SQ-HOP-14)
@draft visual: a runner client takes a screenshot mid-break of each rug, the owner judges
